                                "example_id": "08217adc-eed0-42f4-8eab-029a6f374fb6",
                                "sense_id": "539b5199-5ece-3b94-84ef-d690d952cb97",
                                "text": "I'd buy you Rogaine / When you start losing all your hair / Sew on patches / To all you tear"
